    <small style="color: #64748b; font-style: italic;">Figure 9.1: Active Patrol Console with Live GPS Telemetry, Distance Calculation, & Vector Trail Map</small><br><br>
    <img src="file:///C:/Users/muhan/.gemini/antigravity/brain/319799a5-9c5c-4fb5-8fba-fbc52878e0b3/incident_report_modal_1791516433494.jpg" style="max-width: 540pt; border: 1px solid #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 6pt;" /><br>
